    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d233">

                <pb facs="0316" n="232" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg232"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ehrman to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1903</hi>.</date><lb/>(Received 9.50 a.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Cables <hi rendition="#italic">Nashville</hi> received. <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nashville</hi> notified. Troops will not be moved. Last night gunboat <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi> fired several shells on city; one Chinaman
                    killed. <hi rendition="#italic">Bogotá</hi> threatens bombard city to-day.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ehrman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
